2026-11-07T12:10:34.4636330Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5321360Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5375180Z [0m
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5375760Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5376290Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5376470Z 
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5376710Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5377080Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5377300Z 
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5377460Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5377920Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5378900Z 
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5379230Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [351..356])[0m and groups [34m(gid 350)[0m
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5379650Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5380000Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5380340Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5380540Z 
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5380680Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5380960Z 
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5381220Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5381670Z    can use Nix.
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5381780Z 
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5381940Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5382120Z 
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5383500Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5384050Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5428000Z 
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5430490Z I will:
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5431200Z 
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5432080Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5434650Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5435840Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5436920Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5437350Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5437630Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5438070Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5438520Z    /var/root
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5480400Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T12:10:34.5482720Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
